<sect>quatern (Revision 1.1 -- 22/04/1998)

<p> The unit <tt/quatern/ regroups routines for rotations
based on quaternions.

<sect1> Routines
<p>
<sect2>q_add
<p>
<tscreen><verb>
int q_add (const double q1[4], const double q2[4], double result[4])
</verb></tscreen>
<p> Addition of two quaternions : <tt/result = q1 + q2/


<sect2>q_mult
<p>
<tscreen><verb>
int q_mult (const double q1[4], const double q2[4], double result[4])
</verb></tscreen>
<p> Multiplication of two quaternions: <tt/result = q1 * q2/

<sect2>q_conjugate
<p>
<tscreen><verb>
int q_conjugate (const double q[4], double result[4])
</verb></tscreen>
<p> Conjugate of quaternion <tt/q/ written to quaternion <tt/result/.

<sect2>q_scalarmult
<p>
<tscreen><verb>
int q_scalarmult (const double q[4], const double factor, double result[4])
</verb></tscreen>
<p> Multipilcation of quaternion <tt/q/ with a scalar <tt/factor/. (<tt/result = factor * q/)

<sect2>q_norm
<p>
<tscreen><verb>
double q_norm (const double q[4])
</verb></tscreen>
<p> Returns the norm of the quaternion <tt/q/.

<sect2>q_inverse
<p>
<tscreen><verb>
int q_inverse (const double q[4], double result[4])
</verb></tscreen>
<p> Inversion of quaternion <tt/q/. 

<sect2>rotmat_to_quat
<p>
<tscreen><verb>
int rotmat_to_quat (const double rotmat[3][3], double result[4])
</verb></tscreen>
<p> Conversion of a rotation matrix <tt/rotmat/ to a quaternion <tt/q/. 

<sect2>rotvec_to_quat
<p>
<tscreen><verb>
int rotvec_to_quat (const double rotvec[3], const double rotangle, double result[4])
</verb></tscreen>
<p> Converts a rotation given by its rotation axis <tt/rotvec/
 and the associated rotation angle <tt/rotangle/ (in radians) to the
corresponding quaternion <tt/q/. <tt/rotvec/ must be a unit
vector and <tt/angle/ is given in radians.

<sect2>quat_to_rotmat
<p>
<tscreen><verb>
int quat_to_rotmat (const double q[4], double result[3][3])
</verb></tscreen>
<p> Conversion of the quaternion <tt/q/ to the corresponding rotation matrix <tt/result/.
(Counterpart to <tt/rotmat_to_quat/).

<sect2>q_rotate
<p>
<tscreen><verb>
int q_rotate (const double x[3], const double q[4], double result[3])
</verb></tscreen>
<p> This function performs a rotation of the vector <tt/x/
 using a quaternion <tt/q/. The rotated vector is <tt/result/.

